                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Caused by &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8429&quot; title=&quot;Unexpected error during incorrect WAL segment decompression, causes node termination.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-8429&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-8429&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
